<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rotor Array Simulation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #222; color: #eee; margin: 0; display: flex; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
        #app { display: flex; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
        #canvas-container { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #111; padding: 20px; }
        canvas#sim-canvas { background: #000; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); image-rendering: pixelated; }
        #sidebar { width: 340px; padding: 12px; background: #222; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-left: 1px solid #444; }
        .control-group { margin-bottom: 2px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #444; }
        .control-group:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        label { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #ccc; }
        input[type="range"] { width: 100%; height: 14px; }
        input[type="number"], select { background: #444; color: white; border: 1px solid #555; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.85em; }
        .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 3px; }
        #uplot-chart { height: 150px; width: 100%; background: #111; border: 1px solid #444; }
        h1 { font-size: 1em; margin: 0 0 5px 0; color: #fff; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        #help-btn { background: #444; border: 1px solid #555; color: #ccc; cursor: pointer; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; }
        #help-btn:hover { background: #555; color: #fff; }

        #help-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); z-index: 1000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; backdrop-filter: blur(2px); }
        #help-modal { background: #222; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 650px; max-height: 85vh; overflow-y: auto; position: relative; border: 1px solid #444; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); line-height: 1.6; }
        #help-modal h2 { margin-top: 0; color: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #444; padding-bottom: 8px; }
        #help-modal h3 { color: #ddd; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        #help-modal p, #help-modal li { color: #ccc; font-size: 0.95em; }
        #help-modal ul { padding-left: 20px; }
        #close-help { position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 15px; background: none; border: none; color: #888; font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1; }
        #close-help:hover { color: #fff; }

        .sidebar-footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #444; color: #666; font-size: 0.75em; text-align: center; }
        .sidebar-footer p { margin: 2px 0; }

        button { background: #555; color: white; border: 1px solid #666; padding: 4px 10px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.85em; }
        button:hover { background: #666; }
        button.active { background: #d32f2f; border-color: #b71c1c; }
        .mean-dir-canvas { width: 120px; height: 120px; margin: 0 auto; display: block; background: transparent; }
        .value-display { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.9em; color: #fff; }
        .legend { display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.8em; justify-content: center; }
        .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
        .legend-color { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="uPlot.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/katex.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="app">
        <div id="canvas-container">
            <canvas id="sim-canvas"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div id="sidebar">
            <h1>Rotor Array <button id="help-btn" title="Help">?</button></h1>
            
            <div id="controls-container">
                <!-- Controls will be injected here -->
            </div>

            <div class="control-group">
                <label>Mean Direction</label>
                <canvas id="mean-dir-canvas" class="mean-dir-canvas" width="240" height="240"></canvas>
            </div>

            <div class="control-group" id="color-bar-container">
            </div>
            
            <div class="control-group">
                <label>Order Parameter (r)</label>
                <div id="uplot-chart"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="sidebar-footer">
                <p>&copy; {{YEAR}} {{OWNER}}</p>
                <p>Build: {{DATE}} ({{HASH}})</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script type="module" src="bundle.js"></script>

    <div id="help-overlay">
        <div id="help-modal">
            <button id="close-help">&times;</button>
            <div id="help-content">
                <h2>Rotor Array Simulation - Help</h2>
                <p>This application simulates an L &times; L square array of coupled planar rotors subjected to a uniform external field, with periodic boundary conditions in both directions.</p>
                
                <h3>Physics Overview</h3>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin: 15px 0;">
                    {{LAGRANGIAN}}
                </div>
                <p>The system consists of N = L&sup2; rotors on a square lattice. Each rotor interacts with its four nearest neighbors via a coupling constant J and responds to an external field M.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Coupling (J)</strong>: Determines how strongly rotors want to align with their neighbors.</li>
                    <li><strong>Field (M)</strong>: Determines how strongly rotors want to align with the vertical downward direction (&theta; = 0).</li>
                    <li><strong>Order Parameter (r)</strong>: Measures the synchronization of the system. A value of 1.0 means all rotors are perfectly aligned.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Controls</h3>
                <p><strong>Simulation Parameters</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Lattice Side (L)</strong>: Adjust the dimension of the square lattice. Changeable only when paused.</li>
                    <li><strong>Initial Condition Preset</strong>: Choose a starting configuration:
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Random Angles</strong>: High entropy start.</li>
                            <li><strong>Twisted</strong>: Topological winding state. Use <strong>Winding (k)</strong> to set full rotations.</li>
                            <li><strong>Domain Wall</strong>: Split configuration (left/right).</li>
                            <li><strong>Vortex Pair</strong>: Opposite topological charges.</li>
                            <li><strong>Skyrmion</strong>: Localized phase twist.</li>
                            <li><strong>Thermalized</strong>: Random velocities assigned to rotors.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>Coupling (J)</strong> &amp; <strong>Field (M)</strong>: Real-time sliders for interaction and field strength.</li>
                </ul>
                
                <p><strong>Controls &amp; Monitors</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Start/Stop</strong>: Runs or pauses the integration.</li>
                    <li><strong>Reset</strong>: Restores initial conditions and stops simulation.</li>
                    <li><strong>Order Parameter Plot</strong>: Shows the history of system synchronization.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Visualization</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Hue</strong>: Represents the rotor's angular variable &theta; &in; [0, 2&pi;). &theta; = 0 corresponds to pointing straight down.</li>
                    <li><strong>Luminosity</strong>: Brighter colors indicate higher kinetic energy (&omega;&sup2;). Zero energy is dim but visible.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
